(4022713, 574486, 81433, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but it needs the rule of thirds used.  If the cross were off to one side or the other, the picture would please the eye more.  <br/> <br/>Maybe a different angle?  Like, if the photographer took the picture from the bottom of the cross looking up??</td>', 'This is a good idea but it needs the rule of thirds used.  If the cross were off to one side or the other, the picture would please the eye more.   Maybe a different angle?  Like, if the photographer took the picture from the bottom of the cross looking up??', '2007-08-22 22:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
