(4022729, 574860, 81433, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of two different colors of paper.  The branch is just a tad distracting. I might have composed it a bit differently.  The green thing on the end of the branch is hard to figure out.  But, all in all, it''s a pretty good shot.</td>', 'I like the idea of two different colors of paper.  The branch is just a tad distracting. I might have composed it a bit differently.  The green thing on the end of the branch is hard to figure out.  But, all in all, it''s a pretty good shot.', '2007-08-22 22:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
