(4022874, 575336, 66597, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation of the challenge, as koi are indeed the national fish of Japan and considered sacred by many who grow them. Fun factoid - the Japanese castle of old often sported koi tail decorations on the roofs - thougth to help prevent the outbreak of fire. As a photo, it looks a little grainy, though his face is quite nicely in focus. 6.</td>', 'An interesting interpretation of the challenge, as koi are indeed the national fish of Japan and considered sacred by many who grow them. Fun factoid - the Japanese castle of old often sported koi tail decorations on the roofs - thougth to help prevent the outbreak of fire. As a photo, it looks a little grainy, though his face is quite nicely in focus. 6.', '2007-08-22 23:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4023036, 575002, 37845, '<td valign="top">Cool star trails, love these kind of photos :)</td>', 'Cool star trails, love these kind of photos :)', '2007-08-23 01:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
