(4023470, 573124, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  The lighting in this image is wonderful.  You took this at the perfect time of day.  I would have liked the negative space in this image to be on the right side of the image instead of the left, as the tree behind the Mosque isn''t as dramatic as the sun light in front of the Mosque.  Overall, a very nice image and worthy of an 8.</td>', 'Back to comment:  The lighting in this image is wonderful.  You took this at the perfect time of day.  I would have liked the negative space in this image to be on the right side of the image instead of the left, as the tree behind the Mosque isn''t as dramatic as the sun light in front of the Mosque.  Overall, a very nice image and worthy of an 8.', '2007-08-23 08:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4023473, 575375, 66616, '<td valign="top">A magnificent piece of sculpture, It looks as if it was crafted last week.It always amazes me.</td>', 'A magnificent piece of sculpture, It looks as if it was crafted last week.It always amazes me.', '2007-08-23 08:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4023474, 575067, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  The lighting in this image gives it great depth.  If the chair had been on the same level as the landing in front of it, this would have been in contention for my favorite in this challenge.  As is, nicely captured and worthy of an 8.</td>', 'Back to comment:  The lighting in this image gives it great depth.  If the chair had been on the same level as the landing in front of it, this would have been in contention for my favorite in this challenge.  As is, nicely captured and worthy of an 8.', '2007-08-23 08:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
