(4024705, 573029, 77196, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a nice job of capturing the rows &amp; symmetry. Making the back top line of tombstones parallel with the top / bottom of the photo, and toning down the stark white of the markers (and if you could pick up some detail of the inscriptions as a bonus) would improve this shot. You might also consider cropping out some of the grass in the foreground and adding some sky. The other think that works against you here is the top line of the tombstones is just about the middle of the photo - typically you want such a strong horizontal line to be 1/3 from the top or from the bottom. It would even work to shift the photo down so you have top 1/3 trees, middle 1/3 tombstones, and bottom 1/3 grass. <br/> <br/>Too quickly in the U.S. we forget that our freedom was bought and is kept at the highest cost. Thanks for the reminder.</td>', 'You''ve done a nice job of capturing the rows & symmetry. Making the back top line of tombstones parallel with the top / bottom of the photo, and toning down the stark white of the markers (and if you could pick up some detail of the inscriptions as a bonus) would improve this shot. You might also consider cropping out some of the grass in the foreground and adding some sky. The other think that works against you here is the top line of the tombstones is just about the middle of the photo - typically you want such a strong horizontal line to be 1/3 from the top or from the bottom. It would even work to shift the photo down so you have top 1/3 trees, middle 1/3 tombstones, and bottom 1/3 grass.  Too quickly in the U.S. we forget that our freedom was bought and is kept at the highest cost. Thanks for the reminder.', '2007-08-23 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4024708, 574545, 77196, '<td valign="top">Or inspiring - something to help us lift our eyes off of our daily existence and think about something beyond our little existence. ''Tis a matter of perspective.</td>', 'Or inspiring - something to help us lift our eyes off of our daily existence and think about something beyond our little existence. ''Tis a matter of perspective.', '2007-08-23 19:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
