(4024736, 574657, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Nice lighting. I think the strong shadows add to the mood of the picture and are contemplative. I''d like to see a little more depth of field.</td>', 'Nice subject. Nice lighting. I think the strong shadows add to the mood of the picture and are contemplative. I''d like to see a little more depth of field.', '2007-08-23 19:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
