(4029543, 572914, 23251, '<td valign="top">Oh, :) I wonder how well this will go down?  Nice shot just a few things, the crop is a little to tight at the top and the lighting is a little harsh, maybe bounce it off something to help soften it a little and finally the cloth, the shine makes it harder and its left quite a few blown out spots.  Something soft and 1 colour helps as you can change the colour if you want. Good Luck! 7</td>', 'Oh, :) I wonder how well this will go down?  Nice shot just a few things, the crop is a little to tight at the top and the lighting is a little harsh, maybe bounce it off something to help soften it a little and finally the cloth, the shine makes it harder and its left quite a few blown out spots.  Something soft and 1 colour helps as you can change the colour if you want. Good Luck! 7', '2007-08-26 07:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4029544, 575434, 81849, '<td valign="top">Wow, great photo! Love the colors and the reflection in the rings.</td>', 'Wow, great photo! Love the colors and the reflection in the rings.', '2007-08-26 07:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4029545, 575404, 45377, '<td valign="top">Good exposure. The lighting is a bit flat in the foreground though. Still, the dense graveyard makes an interesting subject, makes me want to explore the picture.</td>', 'Good exposure. The lighting is a bit flat in the foreground though. Still, the dense graveyard makes an interesting subject, makes me want to explore the picture.', '2007-08-26 07:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4029547, 573384, 48471, '<td valign="top">Why? If it was "forever relying on God" or "I forever rely on God" I''d have no problems with the photo, but as it is, it is directed at me, ordering me to rely on God. But the photo doesn''t tell me why should I?</td>', 'Why? If it was "forever relying on God" or "I forever rely on God" I''d have no problems with the photo, but as it is, it is directed at me, ordering me to rely on God. But the photo doesn''t tell me why should I?', '2007-08-26 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4029548, 574327, 23251, '<td valign="top">Wooh, with lots of power lines, what a shame.  I would have liked to see the whole church as the bottom seems to be cut off. Good Luck!</td>', 'Wooh, with lots of power lines, what a shame.  I would have liked to see the whole church as the bottom seems to be cut off. Good Luck!', '2007-08-26 07:59:11.000000', NULL, 1);
