(4029582, 574569, 23251, '<td valign="top">Looks great! Maybe crop out the top RH corner would have helped a bit. It would be nice to be able to read the sand writing as well. Good Luck!</td>', 'Looks great! Maybe crop out the top RH corner would have helped a bit. It would be nice to be able to read the sand writing as well. Good Luck!', '2007-08-26 08:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
