(4029742, 573029, 48471, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how human society works: (trying to paraphrase Dawkins) the worst crime is killing, the highest honour is fighting. I wish a picture with this motive could convince me why fighting deserves the highest honours. This picture doesn''t.</td>', 'It''s funny how human society works: (trying to paraphrase Dawkins) the worst crime is killing, the highest honour is fighting. I wish a picture with this motive could convince me why fighting deserves the highest honours. This picture doesn''t.', '2007-08-26 11:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4029752, 572610, 48471, '<td valign="top">A mastery use of negative space. I think. No, I know. I''m sure this is a mastery use of negative space, you fill the Universe with a small cross there behind all the chaos of life and you place the cross in the light, where it should be.<br/> <br/>Not that I believe in these things, but I''m just saying that you''ve masterly interpreted the notion of sacred that human culture nourishes.</td>', 'A mastery use of negative space. I think. No, I know. I''m sure this is a mastery use of negative space, you fill the Universe with a small cross there behind all the chaos of life and you place the cross in the light, where it should be. Not that I believe in these things, but I''m just saying that you''ve masterly interpreted the notion of sacred that human culture nourishes.', '2007-08-26 11:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4029795, 575404, 48471, '<td valign="top">I''ll add this to my favourites, but it will get not such a high score from me. The idea and the find is wonderful, man, it''s masterful. But, I don''t know, I don''t like the realization. The colours bother me, the yellowish shade it''s just...I don''t know...hell, I''m going to give you two more points, so you get the second best score from me for this challenge. And, please, consider a better title, this one isn''t funny nor interesting, it''s just clever, but there''s no need to be clever with this wonderful find. Once more, please note, I''m voting and favouring the potential that this image has, not the actual one. I thank you for showing me the potential, for opening my mind and making me write this long comment.</td>', 'I''ll add this to my favourites, but it will get not such a high score from me. The idea and the find is wonderful, man, it''s masterful. But, I don''t know, I don''t like the realization. The colours bother me, the yellowish shade it''s just...I don''t know...hell, I''m going to give you two more points, so you get the second best score from me for this challenge. And, please, consider a better title, this one isn''t funny nor interesting, it''s just clever, but there''s no need to be clever with this wonderful find. Once more, please note, I''m voting and favouring the potential that this image has, not the actual one. I thank you for showing me the potential, for opening my mind and making me write this long comment.', '2007-08-26 12:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
