(4031950, 575512, 48471, '<td valign="top">Not a comment on your photo, but on the culture and history as a hole: do you really believe Jesus was blond?<br/> <br/>In fact, this is a comment on your photo, because this photo doesn''t try to be symbolic neither metaphorical, it just wants to convey something that it holds as true, but the fact is different. And Jesus is Jesus, not jesus.</td>', 'Not a comment on your photo, but on the culture and history as a hole: do you really believe Jesus was blond? In fact, this is a comment on your photo, because this photo doesn''t try to be symbolic neither metaphorical, it just wants to convey something that it holds as true, but the fact is different. And Jesus is Jesus, not jesus.', '2007-08-27 06:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
