(4035271, 575099, 24454, '<td valign="top">Eeeeee. . how TRUE!</td>', 'Eeeeee. . how TRUE!', '2007-08-28 11:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035273, 575540, 24454, '<td valign="top">Hold on while I pick myself up and put myself back in my chair please -- just fell out of it on impact of this photo!  <br/> <br/>Ok there. . . 10</td>', 'Hold on while I pick myself up and put myself back in my chair please -- just fell out of it on impact of this photo!   Ok there. . . 10', '2007-08-28 11:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035274, 575408, 24454, '<td valign="top">And a beautiful morning it is!  I love this!  The simplicity of it is perfect!!  10</td>', 'And a beautiful morning it is!  I love this!  The simplicity of it is perfect!!  10', '2007-08-28 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035275, 574542, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautifully presented!  And perfect for this challenge!</td>', 'Beautifully presented!  And perfect for this challenge!', '2007-08-28 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035276, 575212, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad there''s a person in this to give it perspective and humanity.  I love this composition!</td>', 'I''m so glad there''s a person in this to give it perspective and humanity.  I love this composition!', '2007-08-28 11:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035277, 573090, 24454, '<td valign="top">this is very creative, and I love the concept for this challenge.</td>', 'this is very creative, and I love the concept for this challenge.', '2007-08-28 11:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035280, 574813, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooh.. . I LIKE this one.  Cemetery shots are indeed sacred, and this one with the low hanging fog adds even more to the still sacredness of the scene.</td>', 'Oooooh.. . I LIKE this one.  Cemetery shots are indeed sacred, and this one with the low hanging fog adds even more to the still sacredness of the scene.', '2007-08-28 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035283, 574791, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What powerfully impressive architecture!</td>', 'Wow!  What powerfully impressive architecture!', '2007-08-28 11:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035285, 574604, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  I swear he''s in the room with me!</td>', 'This is beautiful!  I swear he''s in the room with me!', '2007-08-28 11:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035289, 574753, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the motion.  Since participating in the blur side challenge, I have developed such an appreciation for the beauty that the effective use of blur adds to a photo!  Really well done.</td>', 'I love the motion.  Since participating in the blur side challenge, I have developed such an appreciation for the beauty that the effective use of blur adds to a photo!  Really well done.', '2007-08-28 12:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035292, 574656, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhh. . .my heart hurts.  Too much awesome for one dose!  10</td>', 'Ohhhhhh. . .my heart hurts.  Too much awesome for one dose!  10', '2007-08-28 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035295, 575404, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a beautiful urban landscape!  Those sunrise (or sunset) colors are to die for!</td>', 'Wow!  What a beautiful urban landscape!  Those sunrise (or sunset) colors are to die for!', '2007-08-28 12:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035297, 573205, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful the way the cross shadows the Word!  I love this one.</td>', 'Beautiful the way the cross shadows the Word!  I love this one.', '2007-08-28 12:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035301, 573511, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!!  I literally gasped upon the impact of this stunning photo.  10</td>', 'Ohmy!!  I literally gasped upon the impact of this stunning photo.  10', '2007-08-28 12:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035303, 574329, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love how you did this with the larger than life footprint in the foreground.  Well done!</td>', 'I love how you did this with the larger than life footprint in the foreground.  Well done!', '2007-08-28 12:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035304, 575141, 24454, '<td valign="top">How sad!!!!  But very nicely done.</td>', 'How sad!!!!  But very nicely done.', '2007-08-28 12:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035306, 573124, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  It looks like sunrise, and casts exquisite light!  10</td>', 'This is beautiful!  It looks like sunrise, and casts exquisite light!  10', '2007-08-28 12:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035307, 574323, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice colours here but i think a dash of USM after the resize would have helped.</td>', 'Nice colours here but i think a dash of USM after the resize would have helped.', '2007-08-28 12:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035308, 574369, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous portrait.  The golden highlights in the lighting are exquisite.</td>', 'What a gorgeous portrait.  The golden highlights in the lighting are exquisite.', '2007-08-28 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035310, 573842, 78062, '<td valign="top">Dancing on graves... nice.</td>', 'Dancing on graves... nice.', '2007-08-28 12:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035313, 575540, 78062, '<td valign="top">Great pic, but is that sensor dust or seagulls or what? I find those black specks distracting and I thought it was dirt on my monitor at first.<br/> <br/>I do like the pic and with a frame/border and some cleaning it could be great.</td>', 'Great pic, but is that sensor dust or seagulls or what? I find those black specks distracting and I thought it was dirt on my monitor at first. I do like the pic and with a frame/border and some cleaning it could be great.', '2007-08-28 12:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035315, 572875, 78062, '<td valign="top">I dont even know what that is... looks like some kind of crab... up a tree.<br/> <br/>Nice pic but maybe a little blown out in some areas?</td>', 'I dont even know what that is... looks like some kind of crab... up a tree. Nice pic but maybe a little blown out in some areas?', '2007-08-28 12:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035352, 575508, 78062, '<td valign="top">not a bad shot, but im not into the crop. half the face would have worked better in my book.</td>', 'not a bad shot, but im not into the crop. half the face would have worked better in my book.', '2007-08-28 12:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035354, 572866, 78062, '<td valign="top">nice  but more contrast would be sweet.</td>', 'nice  but more contrast would be sweet.', '2007-08-28 12:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035847, 574369, 60862, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, but try as I might, I''m not getting sacred out of it.</td>', 'Lovely picture, but try as I might, I''m not getting sacred out of it.', '2007-08-28 17:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035851, 575171, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but I''m not getting how it shows something sacred.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but I''m not getting how it shows something sacred.', '2007-08-28 17:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035858, 574656, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the subject.  The composition strikes me as too wide, though - the sun and the people are bunched up in the middle.  I wonder how this would look as a portrait-oriented shot, cropped so the sun is closer to the left edge and they''re closer to the right.</td>', 'I like the colors and the subject.  The composition strikes me as too wide, though - the sun and the people are bunched up in the middle.  I wonder how this would look as a portrait-oriented shot, cropped so the sun is closer to the left edge and they''re closer to the right.', '2007-08-28 17:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035861, 575188, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, although too small to make much impact.  I''m also not getting the connection to something sacred.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, although too small to make much impact.  I''m also not getting the connection to something sacred.', '2007-08-28 17:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035862, 574841, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh.  That''s stretching the interpretation, but I can see it.</td>', 'Heh.  That''s stretching the interpretation, but I can see it.', '2007-08-28 17:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035871, 574329, 60862, '<td valign="top">I know that poem, so I''ll give you credit.  For your sake, I hope others know it.</td>', 'I know that poem, so I''ll give you credit.  For your sake, I hope others know it.', '2007-08-28 17:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035872, 574660, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ain''t it the truth!</td>', 'Ain''t it the truth!', '2007-08-28 17:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035875, 575534, 60862, '<td valign="top">I can accept someone thinking that a stuffed animal is a sacred reminder of someone or something.  But the photo says to me only "stuffed animal on a white background."  To better convey its emotional meaning, I would''ve included a person hugging it or something like that.</td>', 'I can accept someone thinking that a stuffed animal is a sacred reminder of someone or something.  But the photo says to me only "stuffed animal on a white background."  To better convey its emotional meaning, I would''ve included a person hugging it or something like that.', '2007-08-28 17:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035878, 574462, 60862, '<td valign="top">Try getting the horizon out of the middle - make it a shot about the ground or the sky.  That''s not always better, but it often is, and I think it would''ve been more interesting to tilt down a bit.</td>', 'Try getting the horizon out of the middle - make it a shot about the ground or the sky.  That''s not always better, but it often is, and I think it would''ve been more interesting to tilt down a bit.', '2007-08-28 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035884, 573673, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, lucky you to have him. :)  I still have one of mine, too.  For the future, try either taking off his glasses or finding an angle so you don''t get the reflections, which take away from his nice eyes.</td>', 'Ah, lucky you to have him. :)  I still have one of mine, too.  For the future, try either taking off his glasses or finding an angle so you don''t get the reflections, which take away from his nice eyes.', '2007-08-28 17:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035889, 573722, 60862, '<td valign="top">The composition and light here really drive the eye toward the cross.  Very, very nice!  In fact, it''s the only 10 I''ve given out so far.  If anyone gives you grief for using such a strongly Christian theme, tell ''em I''m Jewish and I can still appreciate the meaning of such an image. :)</td>', 'The composition and light here really drive the eye toward the cross.  Very, very nice!  In fact, it''s the only 10 I''ve given out so far.  If anyone gives you grief for using such a strongly Christian theme, tell ''em I''m Jewish and I can still appreciate the meaning of such an image. :)', '2007-08-28 17:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4035899, 573894, 60862, '<td valign="top">Feel free to PM me why you entered this, and I''ll reconsider my 1.</td>', 'Feel free to PM me why you entered this, and I''ll reconsider my 1.', '2007-08-28 17:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036083, 575434, 80542, '<td valign="top">Nice way to show the rings.  Clarity is good, too.</td>', 'Nice way to show the rings.  Clarity is good, too.', '2007-08-28 19:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036091, 575246, 80542, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  I like how you''ve faded the words off the frame.  Really nice.</td>', 'Really nice shot.  I like how you''ve faded the words off the frame.  Really nice.', '2007-08-28 19:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036100, 572578, 80542, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective/framing/cropping.  Good light too.</td>', 'Nice perspective/framing/cropping.  Good light too.', '2007-08-28 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036279, 573842, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely documentary photo.  Perhaps those are late spring bulbs flowering?  The richness of textures makes for a nice viewing experience. 9.</td>', 'Lovely documentary photo.  Perhaps those are late spring bulbs flowering?  The richness of textures makes for a nice viewing experience. 9.', '2007-08-28 20:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036281, 574660, 51538, '<td valign="top">To think and to pose.  I can appreciate the set up aspect of your photo though. 7.</td>', 'To think and to pose.  I can appreciate the set up aspect of your photo though. 7.', '2007-08-28 20:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036284, 575002, 51538, '<td valign="top">I was atop the Green Mountains as well during this period (at Woodford).  A little bit chilly in the tent, it was.  But the night sky was well worth it.  The view of the shuttle and ISS was quite good as were the meteors.  I hope you had fun too.</td>', 'I was atop the Green Mountains as well during this period (at Woodford).  A little bit chilly in the tent, it was.  But the night sky was well worth it.  The view of the shuttle and ISS was quite good as were the meteors.  I hope you had fun too.', '2007-08-28 20:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036288, 575212, 51538, '<td valign="top">Beautiful viewpoint and wonderful moment. 8.</td>', 'Beautiful viewpoint and wonderful moment. 8.', '2007-08-28 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036292, 574656, 51538, '<td valign="top">Ah yes.  I recognize that moment. 8.</td>', 'Ah yes.  I recognize that moment. 8.', '2007-08-28 20:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
