(4036759, 574917, 66635, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful picture.  Not sure if the presence of a ruin makes it necessarily sacred; is it a temple?  A great picture.</td>', 'Very beautiful picture.  Not sure if the presence of a ruin makes it necessarily sacred; is it a temple?  A great picture.', '2007-08-28 23:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036776, 573030, 66635, '<td valign="top">I really think this is a great picture of a feather.  And I accept that a feather may be sacred to an Indian.  But I think this would be better if there was something more to the picture to help it communicate the point that this feather is sacred.  Maybe some kind of Indian fetish or artifact.</td>', 'I really think this is a great picture of a feather.  And I accept that a feather may be sacred to an Indian.  But I think this would be better if there was something more to the picture to help it communicate the point that this feather is sacred.  Maybe some kind of Indian fetish or artifact.', '2007-08-28 23:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036840, 574704, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m okay with the concept for this challenge, but I think it''d look better with the blacks more intense. It kind of washes out right now.  Not overblown except in the sky, but just not really deep either.</td>', 'I''m okay with the concept for this challenge, but I think it''d look better with the blacks more intense. It kind of washes out right now.  Not overblown except in the sky, but just not really deep either.', '2007-08-29 00:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036842, 573030, 60862, '<td valign="top">Try angling it for a more interestesting presentation instead of right through the middle.  Also, brighten it quite a bit so that the stem is white instead of gray.</td>', 'Try angling it for a more interestesting presentation instead of right through the middle.  Also, brighten it quite a bit so that the stem is white instead of gray.', '2007-08-29 00:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036845, 574545, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  If you use PS CS2 or CS3, try exploring the image-&gt;adjustments-&gt;shadow/highlights tool, which will bring out details in the shadows (and highlights, but the shadows are the issue here).<br/> <br/>Aside from that, it might help the composition to crop out the left side stuff so the large arch is on the left side of the picture.</td>', 'Too dark.  If you use PS CS2 or CS3, try exploring the image->adjustments->shadow/highlights tool, which will bring out details in the shadows (and highlights, but the shadows are the issue here). Aside from that, it might help the composition to crop out the left side stuff so the large arch is on the left side of the picture.', '2007-08-29 00:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036847, 575420, 60862, '<td valign="top">Here, here! :)  Pretty scene.  Try it with about half of the blue cropped out so the lighthouse is larger and not centered vertically.  It doesn''t always help, but often it adds more interest.</td>', 'Here, here! :)  Pretty scene.  Try it with about half of the blue cropped out so the lighthouse is larger and not centered vertically.  It doesn''t always help, but often it adds more interest.', '2007-08-29 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036848, 575528, 60862, '<td valign="top">laugh!</td>', 'laugh!', '2007-08-29 00:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036849, 574466, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I would try increasing the contrast and correcting what appears to be a yellow tint to enhance visual interest.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I would try increasing the contrast and correcting what appears to be a yellow tint to enhance visual interest.', '2007-08-29 00:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036850, 575276, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle!</td>', 'Interesting angle!', '2007-08-29 00:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036851, 573205, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice way to create a cross on the New Testament.</td>', 'Nice way to create a cross on the New Testament.', '2007-08-29 00:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036852, 573093, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but skating isn''t matching "sacred" with me.  Not a bad stop action shot, though.  I''d just suggest cropping out the blown-out cloud on the left.  Also, you lose a lot of impact by not using the full size of 640 on one edge.</td>', 'Sorry, but skating isn''t matching "sacred" with me.  Not a bad stop action shot, though.  I''d just suggest cropping out the blown-out cloud on the left.  Also, you lose a lot of impact by not using the full size of 640 on one edge.', '2007-08-29 00:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036854, 573124, 60862, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and composition.</td>', 'Lovely colors and composition.', '2007-08-29 00:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036855, 572893, 60862, '<td valign="top">I suggest reading <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this tutorial</a> on how to take full advantage of the size you can use.  You lose a lot of impact by making this so small.</td>', 'I suggest reading this tutorial on how to take full advantage of the size you can use.  You lose a lot of impact by making this so small.', '2007-08-29 00:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036857, 574505, 60862, '<td valign="top">Yes, they are ...</td>', 'Yes, they are ...', '2007-08-29 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036858, 575110, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty eyes.  Just wish they were sharper and the whole scene was brighter.</td>', 'Pretty eyes.  Just wish they were sharper and the whole scene was brighter.', '2007-08-29 00:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036859, 575511, 60862, '<td valign="top">The extremely narrow DOF here leaves me wanting to see more.</td>', 'The extremely narrow DOF here leaves me wanting to see more.', '2007-08-29 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036863, 574059, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good counterpoint to the challenge theme.</td>', 'Good counterpoint to the challenge theme.', '2007-08-29 00:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036864, 575539, 60862, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice still life, but the reflections in the glass distract, including the camera and you over on the side.</td>', 'It''s a nice still life, but the reflections in the glass distract, including the camera and you over on the side.', '2007-08-29 00:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036865, 572519, 60862, '<td valign="top">What''s the connection to "sacred"?  I have a feeling you have one, but neither the image nor the title provide it.</td>', 'What''s the connection to "sacred"?  I have a feeling you have one, but neither the image nor the title provide it.', '2007-08-29 00:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036870, 575540, 60862, '<td valign="top">A very pretty scene, but it''s seriously degraded by all the dust on either the lens or the sensor.  I suggest learning how to clean your sensor and lens and also how to use the clone tool to remove stuff like that.</td>', 'A very pretty scene, but it''s seriously degraded by all the dust on either the lens or the sensor.  I suggest learning how to clean your sensor and lens and also how to use the clone tool to remove stuff like that.', '2007-08-29 00:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036874, 574753, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the blur.  But the straight-on angle is a little dull.</td>', 'I like the concept and the blur.  But the straight-on angle is a little dull.', '2007-08-29 00:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036876, 572835, 60862, '<td valign="top">Take a look at some of the other wedding ring entries.  Putting it dead center and hiding most of it in the box really reduces the impact.  Try different angles, different lighting, sometimes include shadows, etc.</td>', 'Take a look at some of the other wedding ring entries.  Putting it dead center and hiding most of it in the box really reduces the impact.  Try different angles, different lighting, sometimes include shadows, etc.', '2007-08-29 00:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036884, 575387, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love it!</td>', 'Wow! Love it!', '2007-08-29 00:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036885, 575461, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh, I''ll grant you that connection!</td>', 'Heh, I''ll grant you that connection!', '2007-08-29 00:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036889, 574764, 60862, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Long exposure?</td>', 'WOW!  Long exposure?', '2007-08-29 00:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036890, 573813, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, this could''ve fit into the blur side challenge.  Very nice dreamy feel.</td>', 'Ah, this could''ve fit into the blur side challenge.  Very nice dreamy feel.', '2007-08-29 00:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036891, 575467, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I''m giving you 5 for the photo plus two for the concept. :)</td>', 'Ha!  I''m giving you 5 for the photo plus two for the concept. :)', '2007-08-29 00:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036893, 573511, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but you''ve got some banding in the upper left.  I get that sometimes when I push up the contrast in the sky too much.  Did you apply the purple via a gradient or gradient map?  That might have created the banding, too.</td>', 'Beautiful, but you''ve got some banding in the upper left.  I get that sometimes when I push up the contrast in the sky too much.  Did you apply the purple via a gradient or gradient map?  That might have created the banding, too.', '2007-08-29 00:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036921, 573511, 40718, '<td valign="top">WOOOOOOOO!!!!  First ribbon!  First blue!  Sweet, sweet action!</td>', 'WOOOOOOOO!!!!  First ribbon!  First blue!  Sweet, sweet action!', '2007-08-29 01:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036922, 573511, 5112, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS!  Many, many congratulations!  I''m very happy for you.</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS!  Many, many congratulations!  I''m very happy for you.', '2007-08-29 01:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036924, 573511, 79720, '<td valign="top">Yup, gave it a 10. Beautiful image. Congratulations.</td>', 'Yup, gave it a 10. Beautiful image. Congratulations.', '2007-08-29 01:03:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036927, 573511, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Mae!  Any of that chocolate bar left? ;) First ribbon, and it''s a blue!  Plus a new personal best.  Way to go!</td>', 'Congrats, Mae!  Any of that chocolate bar left? ;) First ribbon, and it''s a blue!  Plus a new personal best.  Way to go!', '2007-08-29 01:04:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036928, 574764, 79720, '<td valign="top">...aaaand my other 10. Wow. I can feel the power. Well-deserved ribbon.</td>', '...aaaand my other 10. Wow. I can feel the power. Well-deserved ribbon.', '2007-08-29 01:04:18.000000', NULL, 0),
