(4036961, 573511, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Congrats! Beautiful shot!', '2007-08-29 01:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036966, 572894, 81081, '<td valign="top">if you think a car is sacred, you got some bigger issues.</td>', 'if you think a car is sacred, you got some bigger issues.', '2007-08-29 01:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036974, 573124, 70661, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and great score! Congrats!!</td>', 'Beautiful shot and great score! Congrats!!', '2007-08-29 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036977, 573511, 42013, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Great shot and the layering is spectacular.</td>', 'Congrats! Great shot and the layering is spectacular.', '2007-08-29 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4036982, 574764, 65319, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon!  This one was my favorite in the challenge and going right into my favs...a shot of a life time!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon!  This one was my favorite in the challenge and going right into my favs...a shot of a life time!', '2007-08-29 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037015, 574860, 49954, '<td valign="top">Hey cool!  Thanks ever''body!  45th place is pretty darn cool for my second effort.<br/> <br/>This was natural lighting with one unnatural light shining across the surface (almost level).  It was a Bible that I bought at an estate sale from the early 1900s and was used in the 1940s.  I was going to use John 3:16, but it was split on two pages front and back.  I then decided to use the 23rd Psalm as a good sacred text.  The flower was pressed into the Bible at that page already.  The news clipping listing the other verses was tucked in elsewhere... Since Psalm 23 was on there, I opted to include it as well.</td>', 'Hey cool!  Thanks ever''body!  45th place is pretty darn cool for my second effort. This was natural lighting with one unnatural light shining across the surface (almost level).  It was a Bible that I bought at an estate sale from the early 1900s and was used in the 1940s.  I was going to use John 3:16, but it was split on two pages front and back.  I then decided to use the 23rd Psalm as a good sacred text.  The flower was pressed into the Bible at that page already.  The news clipping listing the other verses was tucked in elsewhere... Since Psalm 23 was on there, I opted to include it as well.', '2007-08-29 01:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037040, 574394, 67841, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot! Personally, I think it hits the challenge right on...</td>', 'Gorgeous shot! Personally, I think it hits the challenge right on...', '2007-08-29 01:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037049, 574604, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, and very creative and effective shoehorn.</td>', 'Excellent image, and very creative and effective shoehorn.', '2007-08-29 01:34:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037052, 574604, 65319, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Top 10!!!  I love the detail and the sharpness!!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your Top 10!!!  I love the detail and the sharpness!!!', '2007-08-29 01:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037057, 573511, 52549, '<td valign="top">Big congrats on your first ribbon, Mae! This is definitely a top shot. Stunning.</td>', 'Big congrats on your first ribbon, Mae! This is definitely a top shot. Stunning.', '2007-08-29 01:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037058, 573989, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice for this challenge, and a very nice image.  Congrats on the top ten, too!</td>', 'Excellent choice for this challenge, and a very nice image.  Congrats on the top ten, too!', '2007-08-29 01:35:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037069, 574764, 52549, '<td valign="top">Amazing, awesome shot! Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'Amazing, awesome shot! Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2007-08-29 01:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037072, 573842, 35669, '<td valign="top">very worthy winner, great to see.</td>', 'very worthy winner, great to see.', '2007-08-29 01:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037074, 575002, 65319, '<td valign="top">So this one is yours!!!  Wow!  I''d love to have this one in my own collection...can I borrow it?!!  Hehe.  The composition with the spiral off center is outstanding.</td>', 'So this one is yours!!!  Wow!  I''d love to have this one in my own collection...can I borrow it?!!  Hehe.  The composition with the spiral off center is outstanding.', '2007-08-29 01:37:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037078, 573842, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon with this beauty, Caroline.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon with this beauty, Caroline.', '2007-08-29 01:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037104, 573511, 16241, '<td valign="top">oh my!  beautiful, congrats.  from the plane??<br/>is blue your fav. color now? ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-29 01:29:50.</i></td>', 'oh my!  beautiful, congrats.  from the plane??is blue your fav. color now? ;)', '2007-08-29 01:41:45.000000', '2007-08-29 02:29:50.000000', 0),
(4037114, 575528, 68504, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for helping me milk the cow.  Sculptor is Nicola Prinsen, who gave permission, and has done even more amazing things than this.</td>', 'Thank you all for helping me milk the cow.  Sculptor is Nicola Prinsen, who gave permission, and has done even more amazing things than this.', '2007-08-29 01:43:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037118, 574841, 79720, '<td valign="top">Note to Self: No-one cares what <i><b>you</b></i> think is sacred. Stick to the Challenge Topic next time, dummy.</td>', 'Note to Self: No-one cares what you think is sacred. Stick to the Challenge Topic next time, dummy.', '2007-08-29 01:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037124, 574841, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vtruan:</b></div><hr/><i> Sacred is an ace buddy.....:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No...that''s a <b><i>miracle</i></b>. :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-29 00:46:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by vtruan: Sacred is an ace buddy.....:)  No...that''s a miracle. :-)', '2007-08-29 01:45:07.000000', '2007-08-29 01:46:27.000000', 0),
(4037136, 574841, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by maymay:</b></div><hr/><i> what is sacred about this </i></td></tr></table> <br/>If I need to explain it...then I did a poor job of thinking out the challenge. Sorry. :-(<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-29 00:46:38.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by maymay: what is sacred about this  If I need to explain it...then I did a poor job of thinking out the challenge. Sorry. :-(', '2007-08-29 01:46:14.000000', '2007-08-29 01:46:38.000000', 0),
(4037137, 575476, 83080, '<td valign="top">Yes, this was more of a joke than anything.  I was not going to enter this challenge, but this turned up while shooting some water drops.  Yes, it''s out of focus and I wasn''t that happy with it.  I just thought it would give a few people a chuckle.<br/> <br/>The thing that scares me is that there are some 8,9 &amp; 10 scores here?!?  If that was from anyone reading this, thanks, but aside from the focus being off, it really is a tenious tie to the challenge at best(to paraphrase Shadowi6).</td>', 'Yes, this was more of a joke than anything.  I was not going to enter this challenge, but this turned up while shooting some water drops.  Yes, it''s out of focus and I wasn''t that happy with it.  I just thought it would give a few people a chuckle. The thing that scares me is that there are some 8,9 & 10 scores here?!?  If that was from anyone reading this, thanks, but aside from the focus being off, it really is a tenious tie to the challenge at best(to paraphrase Shadowi6).', '2007-08-29 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037140, 573842, 16241, '<td valign="top">sweet, congrats.</td>', 'sweet, congrats.', '2007-08-29 01:46:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037148, 573511, 80976, '<td valign="top">First Ribbon for the D40 and it''s a blue! Nice work.</td>', 'First Ribbon for the D40 and it''s a blue! Nice work.', '2007-08-29 01:48:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037152, 573722, 61818, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this didn''t ribbon.  Two #@$%ing landscapes shoe-horned into 1st and 2nd place and this gets robbed.</td>', 'I can''t believe this didn''t ribbon.  Two #@$%ing landscapes shoe-horned into 1st and 2nd place and this gets robbed.', '2007-08-29 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037166, 572475, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is exceptionally well done - one of my top picks in this challenge.  Please don''t change your style - it may not always score well here but I assure you it is appreciated.  Thanks for sharing this.</td>', 'This is exceptionally well done - one of my top picks in this challenge.  Please don''t change your style - it may not always score well here but I assure you it is appreciated.  Thanks for sharing this.', '2007-08-29 01:53:20.000000', NULL, 0),
