(4039060, 572850, 63206, '<td valign="top">Wow, good concept, it is a waste isn''t it?  Agree with other comments, it seems too washed out.  Maybe would have helped to shoot it vertical rather than horizontal.  Could have gotten the full flag (heavenward feeling, maybe), lost the other headstone on the right (which distracts). Again, good concept, if this looked great on your computer, I''d check your monitor.  Good luck, good shooting and keep trying!!</td>', 'Wow, good concept, it is a waste isn''t it?  Agree with other comments, it seems too washed out.  Maybe would have helped to shoot it vertical rather than horizontal.  Could have gotten the full flag (heavenward feeling, maybe), lost the other headstone on the right (which distracts). Again, good concept, if this looked great on your computer, I''d check your monitor.  Good luck, good shooting and keep trying!!', '2007-08-29 15:55:10.000000', NULL, 0),
