(4042394, 573722, 77195, '<td valign="top">hi all thank you for your kind comments, and for those who tried to push this for blue ribbon. There''s always next time. i have to say, after getting this 4th, i truly appreciate the effort and creativity that people  put in to meet these challenges theme and deadlines. I have so many nice photos that have won awards in my country and on the international stage, but of course i cant submit them. Which is why the people who have won ribbons and top 10-20, and those who will do in the future, i take my hat of for all of you.<br/> <br/>This photo shoot was actually of a wedding client of mine who was kind enough to volunteer to be my model. i cant wait for their weddings to come because i have so many great ideas for their days. their pictures will be stunning. <br/> <br/>processing is just raw conversion, channel mixing and lots of curves and colour balance. i think in all there are around 15 layers. <br/> <br/>you will see another picture of him in the free challenge.</td>', 'hi all thank you for your kind comments, and for those who tried to push this for blue ribbon. There''s always next time. i have to say, after getting this 4th, i truly appreciate the effort and creativity that people  put in to meet these challenges theme and deadlines. I have so many nice photos that have won awards in my country and on the international stage, but of course i cant submit them. Which is why the people who have won ribbons and top 10-20, and those who will do in the future, i take my hat of for all of you. This photo shoot was actually of a wedding client of mine who was kind enough to volunteer to be my model. i cant wait for their weddings to come because i have so many great ideas for their days. their pictures will be stunning.  processing is just raw conversion, channel mixing and lots of curves and colour balance. i think in all there are around 15 layers.  you will see another picture of him in the free challenge.', '2007-08-30 19:34:23.000000', NULL, 0),
