(4044284, 574660, 67535, '<td valign="top">Hey everyone--<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the votes on this image, one of my personal favorites thus far. Unfortunately, I was unable to submit an original for this image, being in Boston for the past week. It is unfortunate that this would have been my first Honorable Mention, but there are plenty more challenges that I will participate in in the near future. <br/> <br/>Once again, thank you for the kind comments and votes, and I look forward to entering in more competitions.<br/> <br/>-Cory</td>', 'Hey everyone-- Thanks for all the votes on this image, one of my personal favorites thus far. Unfortunately, I was unable to submit an original for this image, being in Boston for the past week. It is unfortunate that this would have been my first Honorable Mention, but there are plenty more challenges that I will participate in in the near future.  Once again, thank you for the kind comments and votes, and I look forward to entering in more competitions. -Cory', '2007-08-31 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
