(4055428, 572955, 37673, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm this is a tough critique, I really want to like but I''m not sure if it for fear of going to hell if I don''t. It''s a bit off on focus It looks as though you may have burned the little guys head too much although your breakdown says different. It lacks detail and solid eye catching anything. I''m sorry but I feel this photo is bad.  This is my opinion so you can take it for what it''s worth. Ive shot thousands of bad pics I just think this could not have been photod in any way that would have made it pleaseing. Please keep going and try again. Sorry I had to write it this way I just seen no other way.</td>', 'Hmmmm this is a tough critique, I really want to like but I''m not sure if it for fear of going to hell if I don''t. It''s a bit off on focus It looks as though you may have burned the little guys head too much although your breakdown says different. It lacks detail and solid eye catching anything. I''m sorry but I feel this photo is bad.  This is my opinion so you can take it for what it''s worth. Ive shot thousands of bad pics I just think this could not have been photod in any way that would have made it pleaseing. Please keep going and try again. Sorry I had to write it this way I just seen no other way.', '2007-09-04 03:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055429, 572955, 37673, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm this is a tough critique, I really want to like but I''m not sure if it for fear of going to hell if I don''t. It''s a bit off on focus It looks as though you may have burned the little guys head too much although your breakdown says different. It lacks detail and solid eye catching anything. I''m sorry but I feel this photo is bad.  This is my opinion so you can take it for what it''s worth. Ive shot thousands of bad pics I just think this could not have been photod in any way that would have made it pleaseing. Please keep going and try again. Sorry I had to write it this way I just seen no other way.</td>', 'Hmmmm this is a tough critique, I really want to like but I''m not sure if it for fear of going to hell if I don''t. It''s a bit off on focus It looks as though you may have burned the little guys head too much although your breakdown says different. It lacks detail and solid eye catching anything. I''m sorry but I feel this photo is bad.  This is my opinion so you can take it for what it''s worth. Ive shot thousands of bad pics I just think this could not have been photod in any way that would have made it pleaseing. Please keep going and try again. Sorry I had to write it this way I just seen no other way.', '2007-09-04 03:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055437, 572875, 37673, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the sacred cat.  It a damn ugly bug and you definately captured it. The colors are way over saturated. You went too far there. I may have pulled back quite a bit. Composition is fine as is the focus. It''s just the saturation really blew this pick out of contention. Sorry<br/> <br/>Nick M</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the sacred cat.  It a damn ugly bug and you definately captured it. The colors are way over saturated. You went too far there. I may have pulled back quite a bit. Composition is fine as is the focus. It''s just the saturation really blew this pick out of contention. Sorry Nick M', '2007-09-04 03:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055535, 574654, 37673, '<td valign="top">Nice shot everything works here pretty well. You may have lost some detail in the highlites of the pooch but it''s not life threatning to the shot. Composition is great the pooch is not too much in the center where he would command it but enough outside od it to play the rule of thirds. The colors are very rich and vibrant. Very nice shot congrats.<br/> <br/>JTF6Agent</td>', 'Nice shot everything works here pretty well. You may have lost some detail in the highlites of the pooch but it''s not life threatning to the shot. Composition is great the pooch is not too much in the center where he would command it but enough outside od it to play the rule of thirds. The colors are very rich and vibrant. Very nice shot congrats. JTF6Agent', '2007-09-04 03:39:53.000000', NULL, 0),
