(4080114, 575375, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very very nicely done.  I''m used to a different angle of view from other photos of the Pieta, but your composition and the lighting and tones work very well together.  (Also impressed by what you managed under the lighting conditions and the glass barrier as well as the Panny ISO 800).</td>', 'Very very nicely done.  I''m used to a different angle of view from other photos of the Pieta, but your composition and the lighting and tones work very well together.  (Also impressed by what you managed under the lighting conditions and the glass barrier as well as the Panny ISO 800).', '2007-09-11 02:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087995, 575212, 51269, '<td valign="top">Sean, this is amazing- congratulations !<br/>You are always saying what a beautiful place I live in ,but I have never seen places like this...so a Big thanx for sharing :) P</td>', 'Sean, this is amazing- congratulations !You are always saying what a beautiful place I live in ,but I have never seen places like this...so a Big thanx for sharing :) P', '2007-09-13 18:32:57.000000', NULL, 0),
