(4093963, 573825, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how your composition includes those windows, and the other shapes of the ceiling design.  The impact overall could be improved by straightening out the evident tilt.</td>', 'I like how your composition includes those windows, and the other shapes of the ceiling design.  The impact overall could be improved by straightening out the evident tilt.', '2007-09-16 15:15:13.000000', NULL, 0),
