(4727367, 574394, 51538, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  You might lose a lens, but you will gain a happy life.  And that is indeed sacred.  May your future be as green and lovely as the view you captured herein.</td>', 'Congratulations.  You might lose a lens, but you will gain a happy life.  And that is indeed sacred.  May your future be as green and lovely as the view you captured herein.', '2008-05-27 14:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
