(5012999, 575141, 66524, '<td valign="top">Barbara, you posted a great tribute to your Dad - I gave pause to think about his service and what he meant to you. It''s so hard to say goodbye to a parent.</td>', 'Barbara, you posted a great tribute to your Dad - I gave pause to think about his service and what he meant to you. It''s so hard to say goodbye to a parent.', '2008-10-17 23:24:58.000000', NULL, 0),
